  ✓ Stage 4: audit pre/postconditions, real-program pinning, satisfiable witnesses, and concrete substitutions
  ✓ Stage 5: build exhaustive rule/syntax inventory and assess semantic/proof-extension soundness
  → Stage 6: create and run a fresh reachable false result mutation
  • Stage 7: account proven versus assumed, write evidence index and final REVIEW.md verdict
